        "abstract": "The IEEE NANOTECHNOLOGY EXPRESS (ENANO) publishes novel and important results in engineering at the nanoscale. ENANO is dedicated to the rapid publication of Research Letters, published as a web-only, fully open-access (OA) topical journal on topics of great current interest. The scope of ENANO covers all areas of nano- technology, including nanoscale materials, devices, systems, and applications, and their underlying science. ENANO is an interdisciplinary archival journal that is refereed to the archival standards used by other IEEE transactions-level journals.",
